    // instance slot, bound as "extp$name". Only the getter is modelled (an extension
    // property with a setter would need an lvalue path the subset does not have).
    // Variables holding a lambda WITH RECEIVER (declared type Recv.(A) -> R). Their
    // lambda binds its first argument as `this`, so `40.dot(2)` and `dot(40, 2)` are the
    // same call - Kotlin's rule for a receiver function type.
    var recvLambdaNames = {}
